# Personal profile data. Never tracked. One pattern rather than a list of
# shapes, because the list kept missing one: profiles.json, profile.txt and
# profile-notes.txt all slipped through the four patterns this replaces, while
# the README told people anything starting with profile was covered.
profile*
!profile.example.json

# Local run output. Redacted logs still stay out of git, wherever they land.
logs/
out/
*.log

# The redaction sweep's list of values. It belongs beside the profiles, outside
# this repository, and the sweep refuses a list kept in here. These patterns are
# the belt to that brace, and cover the copy the tests write and delete.
redaction-list*
names-list*

# Secrets
.env
.env.*

# Node
node_modules/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Skill zips built for install, see docs/smoke-test.md
/*.zip

# Unblanked captures from a real run, staged for the blanking step. Never tracked.
incoming/
